1 / 0          inf       class 1
-1 / 0         -inf      class 1
0 / 0          nan       class 0
sqrt(-1)       nan       class 0
log(0)         -inf      class 1
-0.0           -0.0      class 2
1e-320         1e-320    class 3
1e308 * 10     inf       class 1
classes: nan=0 inf=1 zero=2 subnormal=3 normal=4
nan == nan: 0 (dcmp gives 2: unordered)
isnan: 1, isinf(inf): 1, isfinite(1): 1
-0 == +0: 1, but signbit(-0) = 1
